Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.03,0:00:08.11,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,75)}It's all right! Now let's move forward
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.37,0:00:11.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,with the sun always in our hearts
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.76,0:00:15.03,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,As power passes through our clasped hands
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.18,0:00:18.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's grab hold of our wishes{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.30,0:00:31.85,OP11 Credits,,50,0,230,,Translation\N FUNimation
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.32,0:00:32.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Working together, let's ride the giant waves{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.55,0:00:37.02,OP11 Credits,,450,0,280,,Soundtracking\NHalee
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.55,0:00:37.02,OP11 Credits,,0,460,350,,Infoboxes/Title Card\N BernieCrane
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.85,0:00:40.33,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}Let's hurry toward the excitement--\Nthere's the starting signal{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.14,0:00:41.03,OP11 Credits,,0,100,420,,Editing\NFeeso
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.01,0:00:47.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now's the time to set sail-- let's raise anchor{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.51,0:00:47.12,OP11 Credits,,470,0,300,,Quality Checking\NGalaxy 9000\NMr. Luffy
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.99,0:00:55.00,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}Cut through the rainbow-colored wind\Nand head for a sea of adventure{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.13,0:00:58.57,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'll be a journey fraught with injury{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.65,0:01:02.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but what you cherish most will be right there{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And if you get into a jam{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.47,OP11 Credits,,0,30,410,,Timing\NDatenshi
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.51,0:01:08.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll always be there to protect you{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.51,0:01:13.36,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all right! Now let's move forward{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.10,0:01:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's go ahead and move on\NThe moon will always come to
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.71,0:01:16.85,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}with the sun always in our hearts{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.02,0:01:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the moon The wind will come\Nand see the light of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.23,0:01:20.35,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}If a storm hits, let's put\Nour arms around each other{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.46,0:01:24.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,0)}{\i1}and gaze at the light beyond{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.72,0:01:27.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we gather up the pieces of our dreams{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.46,0:01:31.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they'll make a map leading to tomorrow{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.73,0:01:34.75,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So let's grab hold of our wishes{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.20,0:01:40.48,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}under the same flag-- together, we're one{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's back on his feet yet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may fall... Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:01:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he gets right back up every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you just stay down?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll kill yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.10,0:02:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.72,0:02:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's battered and bruised! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tired and out of breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so with a glamour in his eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All for the sake of his friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this is a daily backbite!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so curious, I can't see straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.82,0:02:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Luffy! Luffy! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crowd has spoken!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure has touched our hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has ever lasted\Nthis long against our boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has ever shown so much courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.52,0:02:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiots! Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:03:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize you're\Ntelling me of the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss! Come on, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss! Come on, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll end this soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.79,0:03:18.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow Beam Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Slow Beam Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His poor legs are too worn out to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me put you to rest!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.62,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slash the beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss goes on the offensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He slowed down the\Ncannonball, but to what end?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.05,0:03:39.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Foxy Fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flying Foxy Fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out for my flying fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna knock you out\Nat the speed of a cannonball!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using the Flying Foxy\NFighter to finish his foe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be slow now, but once the\Nbeam wears off, there's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, he used this beam on you\Na few seconds before the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dodge as soon as you're back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.46,0:04:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sean recovers, but is it too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but I'm too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's about to blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you like to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't think Straw Hat will\Nbe getting up from that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how do you plan to beat me if\Nyou can't even stand up straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how you want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then others have to pound your face\Nin until you stay down for good.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.99,0:05:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Megaton Nine-Tails...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megaton, nine tails!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.54,0:05:29.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rubber...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come, come!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.93,0:05:32.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.42,0:05:36.03,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gatling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such intensity!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fighters are unleashing a flurry\Nof fists at lightning speed! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slaughter that box! So\Nfast! So strong! So brutal!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.31,0:06:04.81,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stopped moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Straw Hat had his bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on his knees, but he's still moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike our boss who's standing,\Nbut strangely frozen in place!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.96,0:06:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A piece of mirror has\Nfallen from Shulha's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was stuck in my afro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it when I broke the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.04,0:07:03.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rubber...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.75,0:07:13.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flail!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh, oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eight seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this be the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.64,0:07:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say it ain't so!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get along with me! Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll all be at the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's everyone together now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up goes our boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,high into the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now he finally comes down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get dead! Get dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.36,0:08:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outside the battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, the final round of\Nthe daily back fight has come to an end!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After an epic battle between captains,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our boss's legendary record of 920\Nwins and zero losses has been broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you take a\Nsingle member of my crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it kills me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.78,0:09:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boss truly lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've seen it all today, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't just sit there, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.94,0:09:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boss needs our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.34,0:09:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boss needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Davey-backed giant has been toppled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the boy with the\Ntiny crew and the massive
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.56,0:09:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,afro has seized the\Nday in a grand fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little Chef, who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this, and this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poke him to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, afro power my butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a close call if I've ever seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.06,0:10:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey, let's not\Ndisrespect the afro here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened? Is it over? Did I win?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't just a dream, was it? Was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else said you'd lose, but not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bad liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:11:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it would have been\Na real pain if you'd lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine being stuck in a boat with Foxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, wait — you gotta take\Nit easy, hey, Rubber Boy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was pretty attached to\Nthat Windstreak of mine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not pleased about you\Nruining it boss no I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kidding, brother! Let's\Nshake. What a man, the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too kind, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take my shoulder, throw them straight!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.91,0:11:27.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Spiteful Shoulder Throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.94,0:11:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's a real piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.12,0:11:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You forget the rules already? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got no crewmates to choose!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.93,0:11:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't made the final exchange yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll take your flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.40,0:11:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll strip my poor crew of their\Nlivelihood without a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need your sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to use that\Nto go places, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice and all, but I'm\Nafraid it's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:12:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a flag on our sail, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.58,0:12:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need your pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want fair and square, so take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't actually have\Nto take the sail off the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,boat as long as I can take\Nthe mark off the sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can do that with paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you have a new flag,\Nyou should be fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your kindness is all.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.11,0:12:22.09,Note,,0,0,0,,Sail: Fox
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you guys don't have to bow to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, rubber boy, I'll\Nmake you pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's supposed to be a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking, but I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ride on stilts ever again\Nwe'll catch up to the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,village too i don't care\Nhow many years it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.82,0:12:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us you made
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it back we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.74,0:12:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brought you a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hurt, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, this? It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.34,0:13:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why you accepted the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you wanted to help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here I thought you were\Njust being stupid again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you're rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dig?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.23,0:13:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Champion of what? Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the world champion of hole digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As crazy as it sounds, I'm\Nchallenging my own record as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no excuse for wrecking\Nthe old stilts guy's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he supposed to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.04,0:13:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What old stilts guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can manage while I'm gone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.44,0:14:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.35,0:14:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wait as long as I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you better come back\Na champion, okay, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet I will. Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll make you proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so lonely without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You turned into a fine young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.28,0:14:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I didn't\Nget to watch you grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to worry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.66,0:14:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you can forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.66,0:14:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see that one coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I thought about how hard my\Ngrandpa was working on his world record,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it inspired me to start\Non a record of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And suddenly, before I knew it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.94,0:14:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all my loneliness turned into\Na passion for hole digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.24,0:15:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it all worked out, huh? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care on your way home, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever you may go, I\Npray for your safe journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.86,0:15:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.96,0:15:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hold on, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll find a shipwright\Nto fix you up in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!

